#DESCRIPTION
2-level AMR hybrid PIC in a uniform lobe plasma: whistlers across the interface

The GEM lobe state (n = 0.2, B = B0 x, Ti/Te = 5, B0 = 1, code units with
d_i = v_A = 1/sqrt(4*pi) and Omega_ci = 1) in a periodic 3.2 x 3.2 d_i box,
base 32 x 32 (dx = 0.1 d_i), with the patch |x|, |y| < 0.8 d_i refined to
0.05 d_i. The x interfaces are normal to B, so parallel whistlers cross them.
With the coarse E on the interface nodes, the covered-cell relaxation and the
coarse dispersion of the fine-scale whistlers closed a feedback loop: a mode
~6 fine cells long grew at ~40-70 Omega_ci and max |B| doubled within 50
steps (it also showed up in the full GEM AMR deck). Nothing happens in this
equilibrium otherwise, so the transverse field must stay at the particle
noise level. validate.py checks the coarse-fine interface diagnostics
(divB-AMR), max |B| and the transverse field.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
-0.45135                xMin  [Lx = 3.2 d_i]
 0.45135                xMax
-0.45135                yMin  [Ly = 3.2 d_i]
 0.45135                yMax
-0.5                    zMin  [thin invariant direction, 1 cell]
 0.5                    zMax

#NCELL
32                      nCellX  [base dx = 0.1 d_i; level 1: 0.05 d_i]
32                      nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
32                      maxBlockSizeX  [one block per level patch: small blocks multiply the
32                      maxBlockSizeY   coarse-fine fills, which dominate the cost here]
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
T                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#FIELDBOXBOUNDARY
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo  (x)
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo  (y)
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryLo  (z)
periodic                fieldBoxBoundaryHi

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi

#FIELDSOLVER
hybrid

#RESISTIVITY
8.0e5                   etaResistivity  [m^2/s; small background resistivity]

#ELECTRONTEMPERATURE
0.6923                  electronTemperature  [eV; Te_code = 1/(48*pi) ~ 0.00663 code units, Ti/Te = 5]
1.0                     electronGamma        [isothermal fluid electrons]
65.15939                electronDensity0     [1/cc; n_e0 = 1.0 code units]

#HYPERRESISTIVITY
0.0                     etaHyperSI      [m^4/s; unused in grid mode]
grid                    etaHyperMode
0.01                    etaHyperCh

#SMOOTHMOMENTS
T                       doSmoothMoments [smooth ion moments to suppress particle shot noise]
3                       nSmoothMoments
0.5                     coefSmoothMoments

#MINIMUMDENSITY
0.1                     rhoMinOhm

#DIVB
F                       useHyperbolicCleaning
T                       alwaysComputeDivB

#FIELDSUBCYCLE
80                      nSubcycle      [whistler CFL at the level-1 dx = 0.05 d_i]
F                       isAutoSubcycle

#FIELDINTEGRATOR
rk4                     fieldIntegrator

#PLASMA
1                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass           Species 0: ions
1.0                     charge

#UNIFORMSTATE
13.03188                rho [/cc]   Species 0: ions (n = 0.20 code units = 0.20 * 65.15939)
0.0                     ux [km/s]
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
40168.0                 T [K]          ion temperature (Ti_code = 5/(48*pi) ~ 0.03316, Ti/Te = 5)
1.0437e-8               bx [T]         B0 = 1 code unit
0.0                     by [T]
0.0                     bz [T]
0.0                     ex [V/m]
0.0                     ey [V/m]
0.0                     ez [V/m]

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.005                   dt       [Omega_ci^-1]

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI  [m; lNorm = 100 km]
1.0e5                   uNormSI  [m/s; uNorm = 100 km/s]

#MONITOR
5                       dnReport

#SAVELOG
10                      dnSavePic
100                     dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
3                       nParticle per cell in X
3                       nParticle per cell in Y
1                       nParticle per cell in Z

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
z=0 fluid ascii pic     plotString
-1                      dn
0.25                    dt
-1                      dx  [native AMR output]

The box |x|, |y| < 0.8 d_i is refined 2x.
#REGION
layer                   name
box                     shape
-0.22568                xMin  [|x| < 0.8 d_i]
 0.22568                xMax
-0.22568                yMin  [|y| < 0.8 d_i]
 0.22568                yMax
-0.5                    zMin  [read by 3D builds only]
 0.5                    zMax

#REFINEREGION
0                       iLev
+layer                  regions

#GRIDEFFICIENCY
1.0                     gridEfficiency

#CONSTANTPPV
F                       isPPVconstant   (per-cell particle count; PC static AMR)

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
0.25                    TimeMax  [50 steps]
